cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Definition of the projected coordinate reference system WGS 84 / LAEA Mozambique"
message: "If you use this CRS definition or the reproduction package, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Gonçalves"
    given-names: "Pedro"
    affiliation: "LNEG, I.P. (Laboratório Nacional de Energia e Geologia), Mineral Resources and Geophysics Unit"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6556-6086"
abstract: >-
  Defining note and reproducibility package for a national equal-area projected
  coordinate reference system for Mozambique, based on the Lambert Azimuthal
  Equal Area projection (EPSG method 9820) centred on the country's territorial
  midpoint. Submitted as a change request to the IOGP EPSG Geodetic Parameter
  Dataset.
keywords:
  - coordinate reference system
  - Lambert Azimuthal Equal Area
  - Mozambique
  - EPSG
  - equal-area projection
  - reproducible research
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-07-23"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21512485"
repository-code: "https://github.com/LNEG/mozambique-laea"
